nt Door).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIce witch attacks from a distance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tHunt it like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">necromancer</a>, however, because it use more melee attacks, summoning a <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">demon skeleton</a> doesn't work as well as it does for Necromancers. Try to corner it and kill it fast.<br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a></b>: Run up to her and melee her fast.<br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a></b>: Try to trap the witch in the corner and stand 1 sqm away on the diagonal (this will avoid ice waves and maximize your damage).<br/>\n<b>Mages</b>: Approach her and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">Energy Strike</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Strike\">Death Strike</a> and rod/wand to kill her.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 25,033 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.59</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"59.469500\" style=\"text-align:center;\">59%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-fil